                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A device that skims.",
                                            "A device used to read and record the magnetic code from a credit card for later fraudulent use."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fcab3908-7e15-3dfe-8e38-bc3f72bd21ce",
                                        "entry_id": "66af35e6-0c11-3120-b322-336d33e6dabb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who skims."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90c98e89-8836-46a3-8363-49b03b907ce6",
                                                "sense_id": "fcab3908-7e15-3dfe-8e38-bc3f72bd21ce",
                                                "text": "Perhaps the greatest stone skimmer is Scotland's own Dougie Isaacs, who has won eight world titles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d64d999-cab4-39bb-9cd5-c57ed4dc8a07",
                                        "entry_id": "66af35e6-0c11-3120-b322-336d33e6dabb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of three species of bird, in the genus Rynchops of the family Laridae, that feed by skimming the surface of water bodies with their bills in flight."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc83c88f-f84c-3104-b99b-222967775aa1",
                                        "entry_id": "66af35e6-0c11-3120-b322-336d33e6dabb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of several large bivalve shells, sometimes used for skimming milk, such as the sea clam (Spisula solidissima) and large scallops."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "623b42e3-ae60-38af-a949-dae703add155",
                                        "entry_id": "66af35e6-0c11-3120-b322-336d33e6dabb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A ballet flat shoe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cdfa1401-2260-348a-90b0-d253c65cd8bd",
                                        "entry_id": "66af35e6-0c11-3120-b322-336d33e6dabb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A loose-fitting one-piece dress, similar to a shift but with slightly more fitting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6117e23c-d587-4f6a-acb4-bc3d2ebd206b",
                                                "sense_id": "cdfa1401-2260-348a-90b0-d253c65cd8bd",
                                                "text": "Classic, box-pleated skimmers and pantdresses stay crisp and fresh, won't wrinkle or wilt!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a7d2d03-795e-4585-b7cb-a76fbc7b5fb6",
                                                "sense_id": "cdfa1401-2260-348a-90b0-d253c65cd8bd",
                                                "text": "The utilization of divided dart control—some stitched and some unstitched—is the basis of semifitted styles such as the shift or skimmer dress."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6955151-767b-4881-a9df-d5b86f9ca7b7",
                                                "sense_id": "cdfa1401-2260-348a-90b0-d253c65cd8bd",
                                                "text": "Slightly A-line, princess-cut “skimmers” were popular as dresses in summer and jumpers in winter."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4cca202c-b6dd-35c9-a491-c2ce56cc003e",
                                        "entry_id": "66af35e6-0c11-3120-b322-336d33e6dabb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of the dragonflies in the family Libellulidae."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "229d5776-87e4-32e3-b51f-8ca49cd7be9e",
                                        "entry_id": "66af35e6-0c11-3120-b322-336d33e6dabb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sailor in the surface forces, as opposed to a submariner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b347cca0-1f57-3178-81ff-73ad4f1cdb3e",
                                        "entry_id": "66af35e6-0c11-3120-b322-336d33e6dabb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A surface ship."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c4fca16-5f62-3c6c-a7d7-50c39e24c835",
                                        "entry_id": "66af35e6-0c11-3120-b322-336d33e6dabb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small, fast-moving spacecraft."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb4479de-2e1c-4af1-9e04-21ccccdccc5f",
                                                "sense_id": "0c4fca16-5f62-3c6c-a7d7-50c39e24c835",
                                                "text": "Kondric stood beside the skimmer for a moment, looking back at his warriors. They shouted and banged their swords on their shields. He raised his hand in farewell, and followed Violet into the cabin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "183f61da-513f-424b-9897-2607a11d6f94",
                                                "sense_id": "0c4fca16-5f62-3c6c-a7d7-50c39e24c835",
                                                "text": "They said no one landed on other planets. They said there was no such thing as a skimmer. Rocky hadn't believed them. They didn't know everything. He wished they could see the skimmer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c48fcb99-ae5f-3f88-ab3c-5e42c693c2a2",
                                        "entry_id": "66af35e6-0c11-3120-b322-336d33e6dabb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of water strider."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "skimmer",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6de7b274-0abd-3cf4-9465-8aadab1e32ac",
                                        "entry_id": "67e1cbab-5dc3-3787-ba0e-f524166f3ce2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To shimmer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ab79060-2f89-30c4-b8a9-419f57edb7d9",
                                        "entry_id": "67e1cbab-5dc3-3787-ba0e-f524166f3ce2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move quickly, to flutter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1b711e1-b55a-4b4c-9d5f-0ae460c34811",
                                                "sense_id": "7ab79060-2f89-30c4-b8a9-419f57edb7d9",
                                                "text": "…he was bounding over the heads of the maidens, and making his feet skimmer against the ceiling, enjoying, the while, the most ecstatic emotions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8d2aaeff-300a-47d3-9fb6-005cb40b9523",
                        "source_entry_id": "f2b36587-26e0-3701-a478-c709aabb1a03",
                        "source_sense_id": "790c3167-e3f2-33e5-bd22-da4e5cd06f37",
                        "target_lang_word": "écumoire",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "écumoire",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d72ca12d-c50b-349a-ab2f-f7b9dc9ccf20",
                                        "entry_id": "2e9910f9-026d-321e-bc46-267b38405c3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ustensile de cuisine fait en forme de grande cuiller plate, percée de plusieurs petits trous ou de longues fentes et qui sert à écumer ou à égoutter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08335de5-4a7b-429e-95dc-c6e1970b171e",
                                                "sense_id": "d72ca12d-c50b-349a-ab2f-f7b9dc9ccf20",
                                                "text": "Et, au-dessus du fourneau, plus haut que les écumoires, les cuillers, les fourchettes à longs manches, dans une rangée de tiroirs numérotés, s’alignaient les chapelures, la fine et la grosse, les mies de pain pour paner, les épices, le girofle, la muscade, les poivres."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c524908f-3602-4607-96ea-50e4903bc046",
                                                "sense_id": "d72ca12d-c50b-349a-ab2f-f7b9dc9ccf20",
                                                "text": "À l’aide d'une écumoire, récupérer les nouilles udon et les placer au fond du bol."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25ceb319-4d31-4c77-9ba3-67ff6cbef458",
                                                "sense_id": "d72ca12d-c50b-349a-ab2f-f7b9dc9ccf20",
                                                "text": "Les écumoires en cuivre (fig. 140), une grande cuiller ronde, un cassin à bec (fig. 141) pour les gelées, un pochon avec son plat pour les marmelades, un grand versoir pour les calottes (fig. 142); voilà les ustensiles en cuivre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "15f57cc0-365e-36fd-8b8d-ba912d8035e1",
                                        "entry_id": "2e9910f9-026d-321e-bc46-267b38405c3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Objet, souvent métallique, percé de trous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1044b4e4-b406-42f7-b7de-419b56e76e7e",
                                                "sense_id": "15f57cc0-365e-36fd-8b8d-ba912d8035e1",
                                                "text": "Belle écumoire, remarqua-t-il. Vingt-huit trous dans le fuselage."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "275fd44f-3b1a-36a2-8513-7af7c7af96e9",
                                        "entry_id": "2e9910f9-026d-321e-bc46-267b38405c3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action, situation, agréant les uns et rejetant les autres."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40021c5d-57cf-4c84-af81-9ecffe4cda6a",
                                                "sense_id": "275fd44f-3b1a-36a2-8513-7af7c7af96e9",
                                                "text": "Pas un, deux ou cent, mais par billions. S’en tirer dans ces conditions-là devient une oeuvre authentique de préservation. Carnaval le jour, écumoire la nuit, la guerre en douce."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3e5a5450-3fd3-4301-b026-6b9fdbe3ee43",
